<item>
            <title>2.1.90</title>
            <link>https://sanebar.com/download</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:16:44 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                <li>Settings uses the shared SaneUI page on every tab: one gutter, a 720-wide window that can resize without stretching off-screen, and the same label-left / control-right rows. About has More Apps (saneapps.com) and a working Donate button. Shortcuts no longer shifts the left margin. First-run Health no longer crams four buttons off the window, and the check does not auto-open when Accessibility is already granted. Free builds skip the login-keychain prompt at launch.</li>
                </ul>
                ]]>
            </description>
